OL,3,ARolls-Royce incident prompts emergency
OL,4,Aresponse
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services are responding to an
OL,7,Fincident at a Rolls-Royce factory in
OL,8,FDerby.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,11,Fit was called to the site in Raynesway
OL,12,Fshortly after 16:00 GMT on Thursday.
OL,14,FFire crews have been joined at the
OL,15,Fscene by police and ambulance
OL,16,Fcolleagues, who have been seen outside
OL,17,Fthe factory.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
